## Architecture Overview

```
apps/web/src/
├── app/                    # Next.js App Router
│   ├── (business)/         # Protected admin routes
│   │   └── [feature]/
│   │       └── page.tsx    # Server component (metadata + layout)
│   └── api/                # API routes
│       └── [feature]/
│           └── route.ts    # GET, POST, PUT, DELETE handlers
├── components/             # UI components by feature
│   └── [feature]/
│       ├── [Feature]Table.tsx
│       └── [Feature]PageClient.tsx
├── hooks/                  # React Query hooks by feature
│   └── [feature]/
│       └── use[Feature]Query.ts
├── lib/
│   ├── auth/               # Authentication (Better Auth)
│   ├── schemas/            # Zod validation schemas
│   └── utils/              # Utilities (error-handler, fetcher)
└── proxy.ts                # Middleware (route protection)
```

