## File Structure & Naming

### Naming Conventions

| Type        | Pattern                   | Example                         |
| ----------- | ------------------------- | ------------------------------- |
| Page        | `page.tsx`                | `app/(business)/bills/page.tsx` |
| API Route   | `route.ts`                | `app/api/bills/route.ts`        |
| Hook        | `use[Feature]Query.ts`    | `useBillsQuery.ts`              |
| Component   | `[Feature][Type].tsx`     | `BillsTable.tsx`                |
| Schema      | `[feature].ts`            | `bill.ts`                       |
| Page Client | `[Feature]PageClient.tsx` | `BillsPageClient.tsx`           |

### Settings Pages (Special Pattern)

```
app/(business)/settings/[setting]/
├── _components/                    # Colocated (underscore prefix)
│   └── [Setting]PageClient.tsx
└── page.tsx
```

### Index Files (Clean Imports)

Create `index.ts` in folders with multiple exports:

```typescript
// hooks/layout/index.ts
export { useBreadcrumbs } from "./useBreadcrumbs";
export { useRouteConfig } from "./useRouteConfig";
```

