## UI Patterns

### Page Structure

```typescript
// page.tsx (Server Component)
export const metadata = generateRouteMetadata("/feature");

export default function FeaturePage() {
  return (
    <PageLayout title="Feature" subtitle="Description" size="full">
      <ScaffoldContainer className="px-6">
        <FeaturePageClient />
      </ScaffoldContainer>
    </PageLayout>
  );
}
```

### PageLayout Props

| Prop              | Type                                        | Description        |
| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------- | ------------------ |
| `title`           | `string \| ReactNode`                       | Page title         |
| `subtitle`        | `string \| ReactNode`                       | Page description   |
| `size`            | `"default" \| "full" \| "large" \| "small"` | Width control      |
| `primaryActions`  | `ReactNode`                                 | Right-side buttons |
| `navigationItems` | `NavigationItem[]`                          | Tab navigation     |

### Page Client Structure

```typescript
// FeaturePageClient.tsx
export function FeaturePageClient() {
  return (
    <Suspense fallback={<FeatureTable isLoading={true} items={[]} />}>
      <FeatureTableContent />
    </Suspense>
  );
}

function FeatureTableContent() {
  const { data, isLoading, isError } = useFeatureQuery();
  if (isError) return <ErrorState />;
  return <FeatureTable items={data?.items} isLoading={isLoading} />;
}
```

### Loading States (Skeletons)

**Principle:** Static content visible, only dynamic content shows skeleton.

| Content Type                      | Loading Behavior |
| --------------------------------- | ---------------- |
| Page titles, labels, descriptions | Always visible   |
| Input fields, buttons             | Skeleton         |
| Table headers, toolbar            | Always visible   |
| Table rows                        | Skeleton         |

### Error & Empty States

```typescript
// Error - centered
<div className="flex flex-col items-center justify-center py-12">
  <p className="text-destructive">Failed to load</p>
  <p className="text-muted-foreground">{error?.message}</p>
</div>

// Empty - via renderRowFooter in DataTable
<div className="flex flex-col items-center justify-center py-12">
  <p>No items found</p>
  <p>Try adjusting your filters</p>
</div>
```

### Toast Notifications

```typescript
import { toast } from "sonner";
toast.success("Created successfully");
toast.error(error.message); // Message from sanitized server error
```

